Server init.

>> message := ['this is a string to be encrypted!'].
>> key := ['secret123!'].
>> vault := Tasgaidh ùr: ['myvault'].

>> encrypted := vault crioptaich: message iuchair: key.
>> decrypted := vault dì-chrioptaich: encrypted iuchair: key.

Às-chur 
sgrìobh: ['Message:'], loidhne-ùr
sgrìobh: message, loidhne-ùr
sgrìobh: ['Decrypted:'], loidhne-ùr
sgrìobh: decrypted, loidhne-ùr.
